**Major (2):**
- **Claude Sonnet 5.5:** 30% faster than the previous Sonnet, scores nearly as well as Opus 5.5, and costs up to about 30% less per task. It even beats Opus 5.5 at coding with agents. A new Haiku is coming in the next few weeks.
